*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : XEL4020-800
* Inductance = 80nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-750MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt XEL4020-800_freq port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=4.1pF Ind=0.08uH
X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=8.5
+ R2=0.0015
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000001
+ K2=0.02
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=0.000782
+ K5=0.000001
.ends XEL4020-800_freq

